<BaseLayout title="About TassieNow" description="About the TassieNow Tasmanian discovery directory.">
  <section class="content-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">About the project</p>
    <h1>Built to answer “what can we do?”</h1>
    <p>TassieNow is an independent discovery directory being built for both Tasmanians and visitors. The goal is a fast, practical way to find worthwhile places and activities by location, interest and situation — without requiring an account.</p>
    <p>The directory is designed around factual, source-backed information. Where possible, listings link directly to the official operator or authoritative source so visitors can confirm current opening, booking, pricing and access information.</p>
    <p>The first public build is deliberately small. Automated discovery and validation will expand coverage while keeping the underlying data portable and reviewable.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
